# Gitignored files copied into every worktree Claude Code creates.
#
# .gitignore excludes `.claude` and `CLAUDE.md`, and a worktree checks out only
# TRACKED files — so without this list an isolated agent starts with no project
# instructions, no doc routing table, and no doc-qa definition. It would then
# guess at rules the foundation docs already wrote down, which is the one failure
# mode this repo is organized to prevent.
#
# .claude/worktrees/ is deliberately NOT listed: copying it would nest worktrees
# inside worktrees.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/agents/
.claude/commands/
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Secrets: DB credentials, session secret, VAPID keys. Server tests fail at boot
# without them (architecture.md §5.1).
.env
.env.local
